Upstream: https://github.com/webframp/swamp-extensions

Modifications made in this fork:

- The `apiKey` global argument is now optional, so anonymous access to the
  public swamp-club Lab API works and the model auto-registers without
  credentials. Upstream requires it (`z.string().min(1)`, sensitive, strict).
- Added a `search_lab_issues` method that lists and paginates the Lab issue
  collection (`GET /api/v1/lab/issues`), normalised with `createdAt` /
  `updatedAt`, instead of only reading a single issue by number.
- Added an explicit `truncated` flag to the issue-list output schema.
- Added HTTP `Retry-After` / 429 handling and a descriptive timeout error.

The upstream SPDX license identifier (`Apache-2.0`) is retained in the file
header.

### github_commits.ts

`github_commits.ts` is an original `export const extension` that adds methods to
`@webframp/github` (Apache-2.0, Copyright 2026 Sean Escriva). It adds no
upstream code to this repository; it declares the dependency and extends the
published type at runtime.
